<title>USA: Table of revenues and spending from Clinton budget.</title>
<headline>Table of revenues and spending from Clinton budget.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Revenue and spending details of President Clinton's proposed budget for fiscal 1998 (Oct 1, 1997-Sept 30, 1998):</p>
<p>		    (IN BILLIONS OF DOLLARS)</p>
<p>			  FY96	  FY97	 FY98	  FY99</p>
<p>			actual	 estim.    proposed   projected</p>
<p> REVENUES	   1,453.1     1,505	1,567	 1,643</p>
<p> SPENDING	   1,560.3     1,631	1,688	 1,761</p>
<p> DEFICIT		107.3	 126	  121	   117</p>
<p>		    (IN BILLIONS OF DOLLARS)</p>
<p>		     FY2000	FY2001	 FY2002</p>
<p>			proj.	 proj.	  proj.</p>
<p> REVENUES	  1,727	 1,808	  1,897</p>
<p> SPENDING	  1,814	 1,845	  1,880</p>
<p> DEFICIT		87	    36	    +17</p>
<p>(Note fiscal year 2002 surplus)</p>
<p>Clinton's proposed fiscal 1998 (Oct 1, 1997-Sept 30, 1998)</p>
<p>spending for major agencies with estimates for current year:</p>
<p>				     (IN BILLIONS OF DOLLARS)</p>
<p>					FY96    FY97     FY98</p>
<p>  AGRICULTURE		     54.3    57.0     58.8</p>
<p>  DEFENSE*			 253.6   250.9    251.6</p>
<p>  EDUCATION			 29.7    28.3     32.1</p>
<p>  ENERGY			    16.2    15.4     14.6</p>
<p>  HEALTH, HUMAN SERVICES     319.8   351.1    376.1</p>
<p>*new budget authority for military programs</p>
<p>					FY96    FY97     FY98</p>
<p>  HOUSING, URBAN DEVT	   25.5    29.9     32.3</p>
<p>  TRANSPORTATION		  38.8    38.4     38.5</p>
<p>  VETERANS' AFFAIRS	     36.9    39.6     40.9</p>
<p>  LABOR			     32.5    32.9     35.6</p>
<p>  ENVIRONMENT (EPA)		6.0     6.3	6.7</p>
<p>  SPACE (NASA)		    13.9    13.7     13.6</p>
<p>  FOREIGN AID		     N.A.    N.A.     N.A.</p>
<p>Clinton's proposed fiscal 1998 (Oct 1, 1997-Sept 30, 1998)</p>
<p>budget includes receipts from the following sources:</p>
<p>				     (IN BILLIONS OF DLRS)</p>
<p>			    FY96	FY97	FY98	FY99</p>
<p>			   actual     est.    proposed  projected</p>
<p> IND INCOME TAXES     656.4     672.7     691.2     721.6</p>
<p> CORP INCOME TAXES    171.8     176.2     189.7     199.6</p>
<p> SOC SECURITY TAXES   509.4     535.8     557.8     585.2</p>
<p> EXCISE TAXES	    54.0	57.2	61.2	64.5</p>
<p>(certain other misc. receipts not listed in this table)</p>
<p>  TOTAL REVENUES    1,453.1   1,505.4   1,566.8   1,643.3</p>
</text>
